        <p><seg source="#source-1248-1251">お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1251-1266"><rb>前</rb><rt>まへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1266-1269">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1269-1284"><rb>影</rb><rt>かげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1284-1287">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1287-1311"><rb>人間</rb><rt>にんげん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1311-1314">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1314-1332"><rb>形</rb><rt>かたち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1332-1335">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1335-1353"><rb>失</rb><rt>うしな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1353-1362">ひ、お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1362-1377"><rb>前</rb><rt>まへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1377-1380">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1380-1398"><rb>姿</rb><rt>すがれ</rt></ruby><note type="sic" source="#source-1398-1440">ルビの「すがれ」はママ</note><seg source="#source-1440-1443">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1443-1467"><rb>背嚢</rb><rt>はいのう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1467-1470">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1470-1485"><rb>隠</rb><rt>かく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1485-1490">れ</seg></p>
